{"ref":"BDB, נָתָן","hw":"נָתָן","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָתָן</span></big><sub>42</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Ναθαν;—<br>†<strong>1.</strong>  a son of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.14\">2 S 5:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.15\">1 Ch 3:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.4\">1 Ch 14:4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  the prophet of David’s time <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.2\">2 S 7:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.17\">17</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.1\">1 Ch 17:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.1\">2 S 12:1</a> + 6 times <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12\">2 S 12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.8\">1 K 1:8</a> + 10 times <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1\" href=\"/I_Kings.1\">1 K 1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.25\">2 Ch 29:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:2\" href=\"/Psalms.51.2\">ψ 51:2</a> (title); <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי נָתָן הַנָּבִיא</span> as name of a book <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.29\">1 Ch 29:29</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:29\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.29\">2 Ch 9:29</a>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  father of one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.36\">2 S 23:36</a>.<br>†<strong>4.</strong>  father of officers of Solomon, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.5\">1 K 4:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (= <strong>2</strong>?).<br>†<strong>5.</strong>  name in Judah: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.36\">1 Ch 2:36</a><sup>(×2)</sup>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.38\">11:38</a>.<br>†<strong>6.</strong>  companion of Ezra from Babylon <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" href=\"/Ezra.8.16\">Ezr 8:16</a>.<br>†<strong>7.</strong>  one of those who took strange wives <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:39\" href=\"/Ezra.10.39\">10:39</a>.<br>†<strong>8.</strong>  head of a family <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.12\">Zc 12:12</a>.","next":"BDB, נְתַן־מֶ֫לֶךְ","prev":"BDB, נָתַן"}